# {{.ProjectName}}

A Go REST API built with [CoreGo](https://github.com/berkkaradalan/CoreGo).

## Quick Start

```bash
# Install dependencies
go mod tidy
{{if .CreateEnv}}

# Configure environment
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your settings
{{end}}

# Run the server
go run main.go
```

## Features

- RESTful API with Gin framework
{{if .HasMongoDB}}- MongoDB database integration{{end}}
{{if .HasPostgres}}- PostgreSQL database integration{{end}}
{{if .IncludeAuth}}- JWT authentication{{end}}

## API Endpoints

| Method | Path | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| GET | `/health` | Health check |
| GET | `/api/` | Welcome message |
{{if .IncludeAuth}}| POST | `/auth/signup` | Create account |
| POST | `/auth/login` | Login |
| GET | `/auth/profile` | Get profile (auth required) |
| PUT | `/auth/profile` | Update profile (auth required) |
| DELETE | `/auth/profile` | Delete account (auth required) |{{end}}

